## 2. Developer & API Integration Guide

### Architecture

The platform is built using a modular architecture, allowing developers to extend functionalities, integrate external telemetry feeds, and manage sovereign hardware components efficiently.

### Sovereign Database Integration

Developers can interact with the core database (`sovereign_enterprise.db`) programmatically via Python:

```python
from main_app import SovereignEnterpriseDB

# Initialize the sovereign database connection
sov_db = SovereignEnterpriseDB("sovereign_enterprise.db")

# Example: Programmatically adding a compliance record
sov_db.add_compliance_record(
    jurisdiction="International",
    law_title="Outer Space Treaty & Coordination",
    category="International Law",
    compliance_status="Compliant",
    notes="Regulatory protocols verified successfully."
)

```

