## 3. End-User Manual

### Live Tracking Dashboard

* Allows operators to monitor satellites and orbital trajectories in real time.
* Provides line-of-sight (LoS) filtering and signal link budget evaluations.

### Global Compliance & Sovereign Unit

* Designed for managing regulatory laws, legal frameworks, and centralized compliance matrices.
* Tracks compliance statuses (e.g., Active, Under Review) with automatic timestamping and review notes.

### Audit & Security Logs

* Records all critical actions and administrative events executed within the control dashboard.
* Enables easy review and export of log reports in CSV format for institutional auditing.
